ee 1.2.4 (Easy Editor)

Source was supplied locally in the archived repository's source-intake tree
and moved here for target-port work.
unix/ports/ee/ee.c identifies the source as version 1.2.4
and carries an RCS header dated 1995-08-26.

The upstream FreeBSD Makefile links only ee.c against system ncurses.  platform/epoch68/emulator
instead builds ee.c with the bundled new_curse.c and new_curse.h, using the
CAP (termcap) path.  The two bundled sources were moved from doc/ into this
directory because they are build inputs, not documentation.

V7 target adjustments:
- V7 has no SIGCHLD; child-signal disposition is a no-op and wait() remains
  responsible for collecting command children.
- The pseudo-curses key timeout uses its alarm(2) interruption path rather
  than unavailable fcntl(FNDELAY).
